## The one-sentence goal

A personal intraday Indian-market alert system that watches ~500 NSE stocks every minute,
synthesises every force that moves markets into a single confidence-scored verdict, and delivers
clean Telegram alerts — *what happened, why it matters, what to do, and the historical odds* —
built by one developer, running on one VPS, for one monthly hosting bill.

The edge is **not** being first to news. It is knowing which stocks are *technically, fundamentally,
institutionally, and psychologically aligned* to move, and collapsing all simultaneous market forces
into one scannable, 20-second-to-read verdict with evidence.

