## Intraday force taxonomy — complete map

Every alert is implicitly aware of all 15 categories of intraday forces:

1. **Global overnight setup** — GIFT Nifty, US markets, Asian markets, DXY, crude, gold
2. **Currency** — USDINR live (FII flows, IT vs import sector rotation)
3. **India VIX** — regime (< 12 calm, 12–18 normal, > 20 trending, > 25 panic)
4. **Opening range** — first 15 minutes, gap behavior, volume diagnostic
5. **Institutional flow** — FII/DII cash, participant OI (derivatives), block deals
6. **Options market** — PCR, max pain, GEX sign (mean-revert vs trend tape), IV, OI walls
7. **Sector rotation** — RRG quadrant movement, sector RS rank real-time
8. **Corporate events** — results, board meetings, dividends, acquisitions, order wins
9. **Technical levels** — PDH/PDL, 52w, round numbers, VWAP, S/R zones
10. **Delivery vs intraday** — conviction indicator unique to India
11. **News flow** — RBI policy, regulatory actions, budget, geopolitical
12. **Algo and HFT behavior** — VWAP execution footprint, stop-hunt patterns, momentum chase
13. **Time of day** — prime windows, lunch chop, closing pressure, expiry effects
14. **Psychological factors** — buy-rumor/sell-news, FOMO, capitulation, anchoring
15. **Rating changes** — credit and analyst, immediate and next-day effects

