  written to `indicator_live` and Redis every minute.

Pre-market loader at 08:45 IST:
- Loads 250 days of bhavcopy history per symbol into RAM dict
- Seeds `indicator_live` with yesterday's final indicator values
- Loads blacklist + quality flags into Redis (5-min TTL)

