09:30–11:00  PRIME_WINDOW (full confidence)
11:00–11:30  FIRST_EXHAUSTION (−10% confidence)
11:30–13:30  LUNCH_ZONE (−20%, only > 0.75 confidence passes)
13:30–14:30  SECOND_WINDOW (full confidence)
