- The bot becomes a separate process, OR
- An external client (dashboard, mobile) appears

Endpoints when built: `/signals`, `/profile/{symbol}`, `/blacklist`, `/universe`,
`/admin/replay`, `/admin/endpoint-health`. Standard cursor pagination via `next_cursor`.

Likely around Phase 4–5. Do not build speculatively before then.

### Postgres migration (deferred until needed)

Only when SQLite shows WAL write-lock contention or raw table > 5–10M rows.
First candidates: `raw_option_chain`, `raw_announcements`.
Document dialect diffs before migrating (AUTOINCREMENT, strftime→EXTRACT, INSERT OR IGNORE→ON CONFLICT).

### Documentation hygiene

- `FEATURE_CHECKLIST.md`: move 📋→✅ as things ship. Never delete entries (history matters).
- `LEARNINGS.md`: append every NSE quirk discovered. Read before designing any new collector.
- `PLAN.md` (this file): update when a phase closes. Phases completed are not deleted — kept as record.
- ADR log: one entry per significant architecture decision with rationale.
- Per-collector README in `collectors/`: response shape, known quirks, fixture path.

