## Decision log

1. **Commit to cloud VPS early (Phase 1a).** 2026-05-30. Laptop-only is #1 blocker.
   Minute-cadence signals are pointless on a sleeping host.

2. **First live signals = OI/breakout, not backtested technical strategies.** 2026-05-30.
   The data is already collected; these reach a real alert fastest. Technical strategies
   go through cost-model + stage-gate in Phase 3 before going live.

3. **Backtester is a validation bench, not the MVP path.** 2026-05-30. Cost-blind and
   testing a different signal family. Cost model added and used as promotion gate (Phase 3).

4. **Start outcome-labeling + paper trades in Phase 1, analyse in Phase 9.** 2026-05-30.
   Labeling infra is cheap; the *data* takes months. Front-load the plumbing.

5. **Cost realism before trusting any P&L.** 2026-05-30. Governing Rule 4. The cost
   structure (STT 0.025% + ~10bps total round-trip) eats most marginal edges.
   SEBI data confirms: 93% of F&O traders lose, mostly to costs.

6. **PDF financial extraction in Phase 5, not front-loaded.** 2026-05-30. Text extraction
   works already. Financial-number extraction only pays off when event signals exist to
   consume it. The core intraday product ships first.

7. **FastAPI deferred until a second consumer exists.** 2026-05-30. Direct-DB Telegram
   dispatcher is enough for MVP. Avoids speculative Layer-7 work before the product exists.

8. **Rating intelligence in Phase 5 (alongside event intelligence).** 2026-05-30 (new).
   Credit rating changes come through `raw_announcements` (already collected). The extractor
   belongs in Layer 3 alongside other PDF processing. Analyst ratings require a new scraper.
   Extend announcements collector to 21:30 to catch after-hours filings.

9. **Psychological layer as Phase 6 (standalone phase).** 2026-05-30 (new). Buy-rumor/sell-news,
   FOMO, capitulation, stop-hunt detection are systematic and measurable. They deserve a
   dedicated phase rather than being scattered across later phases.

10. **GEX / options Greeks added to Phase 7.** 2026-05-30 (new). Currently entirely missing.
    Mibian library computes Greeks on NSE option chain data. GEX sign determines mean-revert
    vs trend tape regime — one of the most powerful intraday structural signals available.

11. **Message quality as a first-class design standard.** 2026-05-30 (new). Defined the
    6-section message template. The message is the product — every architectural decision
    is evaluated against whether it makes the message more accurate, actionable, or trusted.

12. **ML strictly last, behind a data-readiness gate.** Both source docs and research literature
    confirm: earlier is overfitting theater. Triple-barrier + CPCV + meta-labeling are the
    correct approach when data exists.

